@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam titleFontSize 18
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F7FAFC
skinparam classBorderColor #456575
skinparam packageBackgroundColor white
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
hide empty members
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
hide footbox
title Refresh — rotation và replay
participant "Axios refreshFlight" as UI
participant AuthService as A
participant PrismaSessionRepository as S
database identity_db as DB
UI -> A : refresh(cookie) qua Gateway/Controller
A -> A : hash token; new random session
A -> S : rotate(oldHash,newSession)
group local TX / per-user advisory lock
 S -> DB : re-read session + user
 alt valid + ACTIVE
  S -> DB : revoke old; insert new same family
 else replay/expired/locked
  S -> DB : revoke active family
 end
 S -> DB : COMMIT
end
alt valid
 S --> A : user
 A --> UI : JWT mới + rotated HttpOnly cookie
 UI -> UI : retry requests một lần
else rejected
 S --> A : null
 A --> UI : 401; clear cookie
 UI -> UI : clear auth; login lại
end
note over UI,DB
Revoke được commit trước khi trả lỗi.
Single-flight trong một tab; không cross-tab coordination.
end note
@enduml
